The legal text is the Constitution of Algeria as published in the Journal Officiel de la République Algérienne no. 82 (30 December 2020), Secrétariat Général du Gouvernement, https://www.joradp.dz, retrieved 29 October 2026. Legislative texts are official acts. No licence is stated by the publisher; the source is credited here.

The Code pénal is the Ministère de la Justice (Algeria) edition of 2005 (Éditions de l'ONTE), French column, as hosted by UNODC SHERLOC, retrieved 30 October 2026. No licence is stated; the source is credited here.

Changes made by Lexifina: the text layer of the official PDF was converted to one Markdown file per article, one paragraph per line; spacing and apostrophes were normalised; titles, chapter headings and page headers were left out. The wording of the law was not changed.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
